  "failures": [],
  "scope": "Re-verification of the delivered archive from the outside: entry inventory, binary hashes against the export records, inherited licence bytes, key-material scan and checksum file. The scan treats the native EXE separately: a self-contained Godot export embeds the pack decryption key in its template by design, which is recorded as a limitation rather than a loose-secret failure, and it only passes when both export records agree on that template digest. Any key material in a loose file fails. It does not re-run the game inside the archive."
}
